end, which is a view framework.

217
00:12:21,407 --> 00:12:25,244
And then it also has a
Julia back end server.

218
00:12:25,244 --> 00:12:27,480
And they are all
talking to each other.

219
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:30,316
